    "detailed_description": "<h1>Add Reverse Dungeon to your Wishlist</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629320/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1700571326\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629320/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1700571326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629320/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1700571326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feel like a Dungeon Keeper against a self-learning AI or get unforgettable emotions and upgrade friendships in multiplayer!</h2><br><br><strong>Defend your dungeon from the sneaky heroes!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629320/extras/03c58308207562a2a5a724e734eaba8c.poster.avif?t=1700571326\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629320/extras/03c58308207562a2a5a724e734eaba8c.webm?t=1700571326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629320/extras/03c58308207562a2a5a724e734eaba8c.mp4?t=1700571326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Place tricky traps to outsmart them</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629320/extras/d03b00536d771897f32de704895ec07c.poster.avif?t=1700571326\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629320/extras/d03b00536d771897f32de704895ec07c.webm?t=1700571326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629320/extras/d03b00536d771897f32de704895ec07c.mp4?t=1700571326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Create chains of mechanisms and lure characters inside them</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629320/extras/be82831ddcaeb8e826899c2771188a3c.poster.avif?t=1700571326\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629320/extras/be82831ddcaeb8e826899c2771188a3c.webm?t=1700571326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629320/extras/be82831ddcaeb8e826899c2771188a3c.mp4?t=1700571326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Play as a dungeon master with friends or become a hero</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629320/extras/4b627763a0f1d2cc3240255c4b5d834a.poster.avif?t=1700571326\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629320/extras/4b627763a0f1d2cc3240255c4b5d834a.webm?t=1700571326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629320/extras/4b627763a0f1d2cc3240255c4b5d834a.mp4?t=1700571326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Don't let them get your treasures, Keeper</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629320/extras/8be3bc95ed41b725727be49529b7bc69.poster.avif?t=1700571326\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629320/extras/8be3bc95ed41b725727be49529b7bc69.webm?t=1700571326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629320/extras/8be3bc95ed41b725727be49529b7bc69.mp4?t=1700571326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Step into the <strong>Reverse Dungeon</strong> and unleash your inner Master. Just be sure to watch out for those pesky adventurers who dare to challenge your might!",
